n the cached prefix. A message that adds or drops `plan_week`/`predict_race`","+  compared with the previous one misses the cache too (e.g. the `plan_week` line","+  in the log). NOTES.md says to keep the filtering, so I left it. If that cost","+  matters, the fix is to always send the same tool list.","+- An athlete with no facts gets a prefix of rules + profile only. That may be","+  under 1024 tokens and so not cached. This is no worse than before in practice.","+- **Secrets in the repo:** README.md contains what looks like a real","+  `COACH_ANTHROPIC_KEY`, and `config/bot.toml` has the Telegram token. I didn't","+  touch them, but they should be revoked/rotated and removed from git history."]}],"created":true}],"moreFiles":0,"changedFiles":["/private/tmp/h-X5e5WP/ANSWER.md"]}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_016sJ83ZE4F7iWwzDKRxKoFj","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
